cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Head2Field, please cite the paper "Head2Field: A Structural
  MRI-Based Neural Field for Subject-Specific Lead-Field Prediction in
  Transcranial Electrical Stimulation", this software, and the relevant methods and data sources.
title: "Head2Field"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
authors:
  - name: "ayakacxy"
abstract: >-
  Official implementation of Head2Field, a structural MRI-based neural field
  for subject-specific TES lead-field prediction from head conductivity maps
  and electrode coordinates. Includes T1-derived head preparation,
  Oz-referenced SimNIBS FEM labels, physics-regularized CUDA training,
  and inference without FEM solves.
keywords:
  - Head2Field
  - transcranial electrical stimulation
  - lead field
  - subject-specific modeling
  - PyTorch
  - SimNIBS
license: GPL-3.0-only
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: >-
    Head2Field: A Structural MRI-Based Neural Field for Subject-Specific
    Lead-Field Prediction in Transcranial Electrical Stimulation
